 ("Song GS3-PU",132.1,29.9,"preliminary 8.9+-1.7 LF pulsive calls 30-240 Hz, 0.6+-0.1 s, IUI 2.6+-0.3; gap 14.1+-2.2; main 17.8+-2.8 gunshots IUI 3.9+-0.3; terminal 3.8+-0.9; rare terminal moan 160->100 Hz 1.9+-0.4 s (5%)"),
